.TH quarters-template 1  "quarters-template " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-template \- Create and manage reusable named creation sources
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-template\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create and manage reusable named creation sources
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quarters\-template\-create(1)
Capture a named creation source from an inactive Quarter
.TP
quarters\-template\-list(1)
List named templates and source status
.TP
quarters\-template\-show(1)
Show one template and its integrity metadata
.TP
quarters\-template\-use(1)
Create a fresh Quarter from a verified template
.TP
quarters\-template\-rename(1)
Change a template\*(Aqs display name without moving content
.TP
quarters\-template\-rm(1)
Remove one whole template after exact\-name confirmation
.TP
quarters\-template\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
